<title>USA: Batteries Batteries CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Batteries Batteries CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Batteries Batteries Inc said Tuesday that Donald Luke, its president and chief executive, has resigned and that its chairman of the board, Warren Haber, will be acting chief executive until a replacement is found.</p>
<p>The company said Luke has agreed to serve as a part-time consultant to the company through August 31 of next year.</p>
